OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Amurdering girl, 16
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 48-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murdering a 16-year-old
OL,8,Fgirl who died in east London on Friday
OL,9,Fafternoon.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to a
OL,12,Fproperty in Grosvenor Gardens, East
OL,13,FHam, at about 15:40 BST following
OL,14,Freports of concern for the welfare of a
OL,15,Fteenage girl, the Metropolitan Police
OL,16,Fsaid. She died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
